{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play a sinister game of poker against blood-thirsty demon billionaires who\u2019ve trapped you on their mega yacht in this rogue-like dice builder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have been forcefully stranded aboard The Avarice in order to participate in an underground tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find a way to win several rounds of a sadistic poker dice game that the elites have concocted on their luxury mega yacht.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will find a way to break the cycle, or will the body count keep rising?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roll to Live</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play for fingers and\u00a0roll\u00a0your\u00a0five\u00a0dice\u00a0to\u00a0get\u00a0the\u00a0highest\u00a0poker\u00a0hand.\u00a0Each round gives you 3 re-rolls. The player with the highest hand wins the round. Play until you've cleaned out your opponent - or your opponent cleans you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Perma-death</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lose the game, lose your life - get tossed overboard and replaced with a new poor soul, and start again. Another match lost is another notch on the body count.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Resource Management</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember to hide away away your best resources in the hidden compartment of your cell for the next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft custom dice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rig your dice up with demonically sealed special abilities crafted using materials and fingers you've won through poker games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock charms and curses for your dice that allow you to build a strategy towards defeating your opponents and rigging the game in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grungy\u00a01-bit\u00a0aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Class\u00a0consciousness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5\u00a0nasty\u00a0bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Revolutionary\u00a0body\u00a0count</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A\u00a0*unique*\u00a0betting\u00a0system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All\u00a0original\u00a0OST</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Completely human-made with our fingers</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3512300?t=1746050666","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/1f8a062e742878792dbf7e03c57ed673bb1f300a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746050666","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/00fe2229f94e77e3246f23ea41b928ec27a57814/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746050666","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512300/00fe2229f94e77e3246f23ea41b928ec27a57814/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746050666","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Frequent depictions of gore - severing of fingers"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play a sinister game of poker against blood-thirsty demon billionaires who\u2019ve trapped you on their mega yacht in this rogue-like dice builder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_parag